    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the mesmerizing world of <u>Flat&amp;fluffy</u> , where captivating jigsaw puzzle mechanics meet an eclectic collection of over 100 stunning images featuring furry, sci-fi, fantasy, monster and goth girls. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871940/extras/07a2a8cf8fa9e01cb1477ab67e1e1062.avif?t=1713775339\" width=614 height=300 /></span><br><br>Featuring a diverse array of themes and characters, <u>Flat&amp;fluffy</u> offers a unique and engaging puzzle experience unlike any other. Piece together intricate scenes of fantastical realms, futuristic landscapes, and mysterious gothic settings, each more enchanting than the last.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871940/extras/a846a9ea7048783731f3d46ed2593336.avif?t=1713775339\" width=614 height=300 /></span><br><br>Unlock your full potential with our progression and unlocking system, rewarding your dedication with access to new images and challenges. As you progress, unlock access to our gallery, where you can admire your completed masterpieces at your leisure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871940/extras/3d2b415a2a308aa76bcd58dec099b67f.avif?t=1713775339\" width=614 height=300 /></span><br><br>Game features: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>over 100 images<br></li><li>relaxing audio track<br></li><li>Progression and a HINT system to help you when you are stuck<br></li><li>Gallery - easy access to completed puzzles</li></ul><br><br><br>Whether you're a puzzle enthusiast, a fan of furry, sci-fi, or gothic aesthetics, or simply seeking a moment of calm in a hectic world, <u>Flat&amp;fluffy</u>  offers something for everyone. Get ready to embark on a puzzling adventure like no other. Are you ready to piece together the mysteries that await?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871940/extras/c2ca2e63d7ec6bf089f1ede1743a7acc.avif?t=1713775339\" width=614 height=300 /></span>",
